    "work_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi",
    "canonical_ref": "PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "sed semper sine initio (1) Haec epistola adulterina est, Liberioque pontifici falso ad scripta;",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 359,
    "date_range": [
      352,
      366
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi#PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi",
    "canonical_ref": "PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "ea occasione, ne credatur, quod aiunt, Liberium vi coactum, Athanasii condemna- tioni consensisse; idque his rationibus probatur.",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 359,
    "date_range": [
      352,
      366
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi#PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi",
    "canonical_ref": "PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Primo : Quisquis innocentem Athanasium a catholi- corum communione arceri, impios vero Arianos ad communionis vinculum admitti laudat; eum non ca- tholicum, sed arianum esse oponet.",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 359,
    "date_range": [
      352,
      366
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi#PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi",
    "canonical_ref": "PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Cum itaque is, qui hanc epistolam fragmentis Hilarii inseruit, Atha- nasit condemnatoriam et excommunicatoriam sen- tentiam laudet, nemo sapiens id ab Hilario factum fuisse credit.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 359,
    "date_range": [
      352,
      366
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi#PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi",
    "canonical_ref": "PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Secundo, testimonio Athanasii constat, Liberium usque ad finem exilii, annum scilicet Christi 357, perseverasse constantem et fidelem :",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 359,
    "date_range": [
      352,
      366
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi#PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi",
    "canonical_ref": "PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "quomodo igitur initio pontificatus Athanasium inno- centem condemnaverit, Arianisque communicaverit?",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 359,
    "date_range": [
      352,
      366
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi#PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi",
    "canonical_ref": "PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Tertio, Liberius illa epistola, quam anno 354 per secundam legationem scripsit, ac misit ad Constan- tium, Athanasium defendit, Arianorumqne commu- nionem summopere detestatur :",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 359,
    "date_range": [
      352,
      366
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi#PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi",
    "canonical_ref": "PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "quae sane ab ipso prudenter scribi non potuissent, si jam sedis suae initio eum condemuasset.",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 359,
    "date_range": [
      352,
      366
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi#PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s10",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi",
    "canonical_ref": "PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Accedit, quod hac ipsa epistola ad orientales scripta fateatur, se, quod fe- cerat ante praedecessor Julius, Athanasium usque ad ultimum annum sui exilii semper defendisse.",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 359,
    "date_range": [
      352,
      366
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi#PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s11",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi",
    "canonical_ref": "PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Com- mentum itaque esse oportet, Athanasium principio pon- tificatus Liberii communione ecclesiae catholicae priva- tum fuisse.",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 359,
    "date_range": [
      352,
      366
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi#PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s12",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi",
    "canonical_ref": "PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Haec Baron. praedicto loco. Sever. Binius. una cum Deo et Patre, et sine fine imperium habens per infinita saecula, amen.",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 359,
    "date_range": [
      352,
      366
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi#PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s13",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi",
    "canonical_ref": "PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s13",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Item (credimus) Spiritum sanctum vere ex Deo secundum naturam et natura Deum, indivisum a Deo secundum sacras Scripturas;",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 359,
    "date_range": [
      352,
      366
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi#PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s14",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi",
    "canonical_ref": "PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s14",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "ita ut sit vere Pater, vere Filius, et vere Spiritus sanctus. Vetitumque est sub anathematis poena quod- libet nomen a propria significatione transferre;",
    "chunk_index": 15,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 359,
    "date_range": [
      352,
      366
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi#PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s15",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi",
    "canonical_ref": "PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s15",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "ita ut Trinitas sit vere Trinitas in una deitate, in una potestate, in una essentia, et in una substantia.",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 359,
    "date_range": [
      352,
      366
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi#PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s16",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi",
    "canonical_ref": "PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s16",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ne– quaquam enim dividitur Filius neque Spiritus sanc- tus a paterna substantia, quae implet coelum et ter- ram.",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 359,
    "date_range": [
      352,
      366
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi#PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s17",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi",
    "canonical_ref": "PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s17",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Est igitur, uti supra dixi, Trinitas indivisa in una substantia :",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 359,
    "date_range": [
      352,
      366
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi#PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s18",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi",
    "canonical_ref": "PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s18",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "estque substantia unum, deitate unum, potestate unum, regno unum, glorificatione unum, imagine (1) unum. Spiritu unum; Spiritus namque non dividitur.",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 359,
    "date_range": [
      352,
      366
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi#PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s19",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi",
    "canonical_ref": "PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s19",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Anathema igitur pronuntio in Sabellii et Arii dogma, necnon in antea proscrip– tas haereses, ad sempiternum supplicium secundum Salvatoris vocem.",
    "chunk_index": 20,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 359,
    "date_range": [
      352,
      366
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi#PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s20",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi",
    "canonical_ref": "PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s20",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Si igitur, frater Athanasi, in hac confessione, quae sola et vera fides est in sancta ca- tholica et apostolica Ecclesia, mecum consentis;",
    "chunk_index": 21,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 359,
    "date_range": [
      352,
      366
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi#PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s21",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi",
    "canonical_ref": "PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s21",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "co– ram judice Deo et Christo, quaeso, mihi rescribas, si perinde atque nos in vera fide semias; ut confiden- ter et sine discrimine quas rogas praestare possim.",
    "chunk_index": 22,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 359,
    "date_range": [
      352,
      366
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi#PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s22",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/liberius/pl8_51_epistolaliberiiepi",
    "canonical_ref": "PL8.EPISTOLALIBERIIEPI.latin.s22",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Illud etiam te non ignorare velim, dilecte, nimirum veritatis filios impatibilem deitatem confiteri, nec– non Adventum Verbi et Dei in carne;",
    "chunk_index": 23,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 359,
    "date_range": [
      352,
      366
    ],
